# A Potion in battle, through the battle bag and party sheets
# (the menu apps the game hosts), driven by keys and taps as in the browser. Piplup L8 at 5 HP; the
# command card's cursor goes to BAG (down, left), A opens the bag on HP/PP RESTORE, the Potion asks
# "Use on which Pokémon?", Piplup gets 20 HP back and the foe acts; then the battle is fought out.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_PIPLUP 8
set state party[0].hp 5
give item platinum:ITEM_POTION 1
set var platinum:VAR_ROUTE_202_STATE 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_202 178 827 up
until idle
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
until battle 900
+0 press down
+1 release down
+0 press left
+1 release left
+0 press a
+1 release a
until app bag 60
+0 assert state bag.medicine [{"item":"platinum:ITEM_POTION","count":1}]
+0 screenshot bag-in-battle
+0 tap row:0
until app party 30
+0 screenshot bag-use-on
+0 tap slot:0
until app none 30
until battle 3000
battle auto 9000
+0 assert battle wild * won
+0 assert state bag.medicine []
until idle
+0 reload
until idle
